WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.420
Billy!

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:39.640
Yes, do you need something,
Miss Yasuko?

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:44.810
How many times do I have to say it, idiot?
I want gold leaf in my salty dog!

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:46.850
Gold! Gold!

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:51.730
Pearl dust in my coffee, ivory in my soup!
That’s my taste!

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:54.740
I-I'm sorry. I just...

00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:00.200
Looks like your brains
are smaller than rat shit, Billy!

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.370
I-I'll remake it immediately.

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:05.950
Forget it.
Just rub me down with this.

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.210
I don't want wrinkles.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:09.500
Right.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:16.720
So what will you do
when you get the treasure?

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:22.550
You know! Pirate Throlla's treasure!

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.140
Why do you think
we're in the middle of the ocean?

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:27.520
Oh, right.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.350
When I find the treasure,

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:32.650
I want to buy a house
for my mother and father.

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:36.650
That's pretty sweet of you.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.200
What is it, Billy?

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:41.990
Your hands seem to be shaking.

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:45.240
Are you turned on?

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.080
N-No.

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.960
It's so rough being a young boy!

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:51.710
Now come here.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:53.840
B-But...

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:56.380
Nobody's looking!

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:58.800
The captain and the professor are napping!

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:00.720
Now come here!

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:03.800
Yasuko!

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.930
What? It's just getting good!

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:09.980
I finally found Throlla's treasure!

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:11.560
What?

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:21.610
So this is Pirate Throlla's treasure?

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.120
Wh-What's this?

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:40.800
That's no treasure chest.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.260
Could it be...

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:47.600
This is Champagne.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:50.890
And it's still drinkable!

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:54.230
There are a lot of sunken ships
around here.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.520
It was probably loaded
aboard a ferry or cargo ship!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.650
You useless men!

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:05.620
I hired you because you're supposed
to be famous treasure hunters!

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:08.700
So what's going on here? Pathetic!

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:09.700
Give me that!

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:22.800
So, what will we be doing today?

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:28.600
I liked the style you did last time,
but maybe make it shorter today?

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:29.510
Roger.

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:34.520
Issei?

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:36.560
Shut up. You're distracting me.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.320
I see it!

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:42.610
The ultimate beauty sleeping within you...

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.700
I'll bring it out!

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:51.750
<i>Issei's so wonderful when he's working.</i>

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:55.420
You're not leading a good life, are you?

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:58.630
I can tell by your hair's condition.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.090
First, it reeks of cigarette smoke.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.670
It's flat
because you're not eating properly.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:07.470
It's limp because
of your irregular biorhythms.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:09.050
You're partying too late!

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:10.930
I'm sorry.

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:14.640
Don't apologize to me.
Apologize to your hair.

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:18.310
You have about 100,000 strands of hair.
So apologize 100,000 times.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:21.730
Y-Yes, I apologize! I'm sorry!

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:23.490
So...

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:25.320
So...

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.700
Tell me more!

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.030
Scold me more!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.790
Hair is a girl's life.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:36.460
Anyone who lets it go to waste
doesn't have the right to be a girl!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.790
You should be ashamed!

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:40.460
Yes!

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:43.380
The Venus Style is complete.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:46.090
I-It's wonderful.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:48.090
Of course.

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.760
It was done by the genius Ariga Issei.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:55.350
Imura, you handle the rest.
Wash and blow dry her hair.

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:01.940
Oh, so you want to run a farm?
That's nice.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.190
Yeah, me and Dick here.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:06.150
-Right?
-Yeah.

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:08.860
We're not young anymore.

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.740
Of course,
that's only if Yasuko gives us our share.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:17.410
Before you worry about your share,
find the damn treasure!

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.540
Putting the cart before the horse,
or however it goes.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:22.710
Don't say that, Yasuko.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.260
Talking about their dreams
will give them motivation.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:28.170
So what's your dream, Captain?

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:30.590
I want my own ship.

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.850
I can't be a hired captain forever.

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:35.810
And you, Professor?

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.020
I'm not interested in money.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:43.770
As an archaeologist,
I just want to see the Gallon's Hammer.

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.610
Gallon's Hammer? What's that?

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:51.410
A legendary weapon thought to be possessed
by the pirate Throlla.

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:54.490
Its existence supposedly dates back
to ancient Greece.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:58.500
How interesting. Tell me more.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:00.370
In those days,

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:06.050
combat tournaments were held twice a year
in front of the king.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:11.380
<i>The winners were given great honor
<i>and vast wealth,</i></i>

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:16.140
<i>and so many knights risked their lives
<i>in combat.</i></i>

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:20.270
<i>Soon, a rumor began to spread
<i>among the knights.</i></i>

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:25.110
<i>"The winner of the tournaments
<i>always had one of Gallon's swords."</i></i>

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:29.070
<i>Gallon was a blacksmith
<i>from a small village,</i></i>

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:32.610
<i>but like the rumors said,
<i>he had forged many famous blades.</i></i>

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:37.240
<i>One day, a knight visited Gallon.</i>

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:40.960
<i>He won the tournament
<i>with one of Gallon's swords.</i></i>

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.830
<i>Naturally, Gallon expected a reward.</i>

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:44.790
<i>But instead...</i>

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:50.130
<i>The knight didn't want others
<i>to use one of Gallon's weapons.</i></i>

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:54.930
<i>The sorrow of the slain father's son
<i>was endless.</i></i>

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:59.560
<i>He clung to his corpse
<i>and cried for three days and nights.</i></i>

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:06.900
<i>When his tears finally stopped,
<i>he heard a strange voice.</i></i>

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:09.070
<i>Use me.</i>

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:15.950
<i>I am that which has forged many blades,
<i>and thus stand above them all.</i></i>

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:17.990
<i>Use me!</i>

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:22.250
<i>With my power, avenge Gallon!</i>

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:27.380
<i>The boy did as the hammer said,
<i>and went to the tournament.</i></i>

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:32.420
<i>He was set against the knight
<i>who had killed his father.</i></i>

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:40.470
<i>That day, he won by destroying the swords
<i>of all his opponents.</i></i>

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:46.980
<i>But the king feared the great power
<i>of Gallon's Hammer,</i></i>

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:50.690
<i>and at the celebratory feast,
<i>he poisoned the son.</i></i>

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:54.740
<i>The son died coughing up blood.</i>

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:59.030
<i>And the hammer was stained
<i>with poison, as well.</i></i>

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:06.920
And so, the king gained the hammer,
but the royal family was soon destroyed.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:11.170
One theory says that the king was poisoned
by the hammer and went mad,

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.420
then slew his own family.

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.300
What a scary story.

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:18.800
Gallon's Hammer, my ass!

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:21.720
Just a piece of scrap metal,
if you ask me.

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:25.270
Forget that, we're here for treasure!
Silver and gold!

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:28.860
Miss Yasuko, what's your dream, then?

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:33.570
What else?
To live a fun and easy life, that's all.

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:38.240
I've been married five times
and all my husbands died.

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:42.240
Two became weak and passed.
Three committed suicide.

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:45.410
The inheritance money's running out, too.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:49.330
I've bet everything I have
on this treasure hunt! Got it?

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:52.550
Tomorrow you're gonna work
your butts off!

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:04.060
The special we did on you last month
was a big hit, Mr. Issei!

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:05.480
Sales doubled!

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:08.730
I'm sure. My sparkle is the real thing.

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:11.440
I'm barely able to look at myself.

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:16.110
So I'd like to do another,
more personal article.

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:18.860
Ask me anything.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:21.620
Favorite type of girl?

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.490
Those who aren't bald.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.250
Type you don't like?

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:27.000
Bald women.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.750
What's your motivation
to continue being a popular stylist?

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:33.420
Very well, I'll tell you.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:37.630
I'm looking for the girl
with the world's most beautiful hair.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:41.760
I see. What would you do
if you found her?

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:46.020
I'd kill her. With my own hands.

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:49.810
Just a joke.

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:52.610
Of course, I'd fall in love.

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:55.150
I might even propose to her on the spot.

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:00.610
<i>It was no joke.</i>

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:05.450
<i>If I find that woman, I'll kill her!</i>

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.330
<i>I'll never forgive her!</i>

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:23.430
S-Sanae!

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:25.970
Sanae!

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:30.140
Brother.

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.810
Sanae! Sanae!

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:36.730
Who did this?

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:53.460
That hair...

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:58.460
I'll never forget it. Ever!

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:04.550
Billy!

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:06.140
Dick?

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:08.260
It's too early for lunch.

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:09.680
No! I found it!

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:11.980
Get everybody over here, quick!

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:18.020
Th-This is...

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.740
Congratulations, Yasuko. You did it.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:33.790
She's eating it. Why?

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:36.960
She's probably gone mad with happiness.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:39.460
She'll return to her senses eventually.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:46.930
The whole world's shining like gold!

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.180
I'm a woman who's got the stuff!

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:52.350
Don't forget our share!

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:56.350
Of course! I may not seem it,
but I'm a pretty generous person.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:13:00.480
Though I don't see Gallon's Hammer
that the professor spoke of.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:05.950
Yes.
But I'm sure it's somewhere in this area.

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:08.620
Learning that is good enough for me.

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:12.830
Hey, where's Dick?
He never came back from the bathroom.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:15.160
He probably just drank too much.

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:18.000
I'll go take a look, I've gotta pee.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:22.800
I knew it.

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:27.760
Hey, get up!
You barely had anything to drink at all!

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:32.430
H-He's dead!

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:36.520
Issei! A new customer is here for you.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:37.440
Roger.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:38.900
Welcome.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:41.360
What would you like done today?

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:45.240
Do what you think is best.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:48.280
<i>Oh? She's got an attitude, huh?</i>

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:49.530
Alright.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:53.160
I'll bring out the ultimate beauty
sleeping within you.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.120
<i>Th-This hair!</i>

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:03.000
<i>Th-This is it!</i>

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:07.010
<i>Golden hair,
<i>as if the moonlight dwelled within it!</i></i>

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:08.840
What's wrong?

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:11.800
N-No, nothing.

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:14.060
<i>It's her.</i>

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:16.480
<i>She killed Sanae!</i>

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:19.190
I see.

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:21.690
I think you and I are connected.

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:22.690
Connected?

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:24.980
Don't worry about it. Do your work.

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:29.240
I'll tell you something nice.

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:33.160
You'll soon acquire a legendary sword.

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:36.660
<i>A legendary sword?
<i>What is she talking about?</i></i>

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.370
The sword's name is Nebestigma.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:42.540
It's a legendary sword
in which a snow fairy dwells.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.920
<i>Its origin stretches back many years,</i>

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:50.840
<i>to when two country bumpkins
<i>fell in love with a snow fairy.</i></i>

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:57.680
<i>The two men fought
<i>to have her love for himself.</i></i>

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:04.570
<i>The loser reached out to the snow fairy
<i>and whispered his last wish to her.</i></i>

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:09.360
<i>“As I die, please hold me to your breast.”</i>

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:15.450
<i>She granted his wish, touching her feet
<i>to the ground for the first time.</i></i>

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:17.700
<i>But then...</i>

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:24.960
<i>He ripped out his own rib
<i>and stabbed it through her chest.</i></i>

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:29.090
<i>He would rather kill her
<i>than let someone else have her.</i></i>

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:33.510
<i>The bone that took her life</i>

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:37.890
<i>became the demon sword Nebestigma
<i>and sought blood.</i></i>

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:42.980
It's finished.

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:48.940
Well done. I like it.

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:52.490
What's going on here? Who killed Dick?

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:56.160
I know!
The killer wants the treasure for himself!

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:59.540
-Is it you? Or you? Or you?
-What about you?

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:01.750
Maybe you decided to keep our shares!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.750
Don't be stupid!

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:08.670
Captain, after Dick went to the bathroom,
didn't you leave your seat?

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:12.800
I went to my room to get some medicine.
I have high blood pressure!

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:17.890
Billy, it's not you, is it? You vanished
several times during the meal.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:21.390
N-No! I was just bringing the food.

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:24.940
Wait, what about the professor?
He isn't here.

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:27.900
I can't trust you guys.
I'll look by myself.

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.530
Th-The professor! Oh no!

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:38.160
Wait! It's dangerous to go alone!

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:42.210
W-Wait! Don't leave me alone!

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:47.630
Hey guys! Where did you go?

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:49.840
Professor!

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:54.880
Oh no!

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:58.430
C-Captain...

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:07.060
P-Professor... it was you?

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:11.570
That's right! Sorry,
but now that I've seen the treasure...

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:14.110
I want it all for myself!

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:23.120
Well done, Billy! You saved my life!

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:26.750
I'll give you anything you want!

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:29.340
Me? You want me, right?

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:35.760
At this point, I'm grateful
to the professor for killing the others!

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:37.340
You can't...

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:40.510
Yeah, you're going to die too.

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:43.430
The treasure is mine!

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:13.960
<i>I-It hurts! N-No! I don't want to die!
<i>I-I refuse to die!</i></i>

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:15.970
<i>Don’t be afraid.</i>

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.300
<i>Take me in your hand.</i>

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:24.310
<i>I'll grant you great power.</i>

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.030
Show yourself.

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:38.610
You're here for me, right?

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:45.700
It's you, huh? I knew it.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:49.960
Why did you kill Sanae... my sister?

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.460
Answer me! Why?

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:56.630
I don't need a reason to kill someone.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:19:00.970
But if I had to give you one,
it's because I'm a weapon.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:02.970
You're a psycho killer!

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.970
I'll make you pay!

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:09.100
Feel the pain Sanae felt!

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:17.230
Are you a monster?

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:20.820
Two weapons dwell within this body.

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:23.740
I will give you one.

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:37.420
I told you, right?

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:40.840
That the demon sword Nebestigma
would dwell within you.

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:46.970
Take it.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.730
You will become a Busoma, one day.

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:01.700
And you will disappear.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:14.670
With the captain gone,
I'll have to wait for help.

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:16.500
A ship!

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:19.300
Luck is on my side after all!

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:22.630
Hey!

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:24.220
Help me!

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:25.680
Hey!

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:27.680
Hey!

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:29.060
Hey!

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:30.730
He--

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:55.710
Wh-What's happened to my body?

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:59.800
What's wrong?
It seems like your hands are shaking.

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:04.760
Are you turned on?
